<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Attribution> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Attribution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Who made or allowed something, on what day, with an optional note. A public view of Attribution; source-scoped values are retained without asserting an unqualified historical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Attribution_by> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Attribution_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Who made it or allowed it: a person, a session or a program. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Attribution_on> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Attribution_on> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The day it was made or allowed. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Where in one source a statement's evidence lies: the source, and the record, page, scan, time, piece of the paper, address or pointer within it, with the quoted words. A public view of Citation; source-scoped values are retained without asserting an unqualified historical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_accessed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_accessed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The day a person read the record. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_edition_date> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_edition_date> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The day of the paper's issue cited, written YYYY-MM-DD. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_page> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_page> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The page, folio or entry cited. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_quote> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_quote> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The record's own words, exactly. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_record_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_record_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The holder's own number for the record, such as a Yad Vashem record number. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_record_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#hasOrHadIdentifier> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_scan> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_scan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The scan or image cited. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_source_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_source_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The record the statement rests on (the original where it is known), by its id in the record's sources. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_source_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isEvidencedBy> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_time> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_time> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The time in a recording. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_unit_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_unit_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The piece of the paper cited, by its content item id. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_url> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Citation_url> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The record's web address. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_LifeEventDate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_LifeEventDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One date of a life event: the words printed with their calendar, or, where no date is printed, the day of the first issue that reported it, or the preferred record statement's date for a death known from records alone. A public view of LifeEventDate; source-scoped values are retained without asserting an unqualified historical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_LifeEventDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#Date> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_LifeEventDate_printed_calendar> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_LifeEventDate_printed_calendar> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The calendar the date was printed in. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_LifeEventDate_printed_calendar> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#expressedDate> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_LifeEventDate_record_fact_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_LifeEventDate_record_fact_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "For a death known from records: the accepted death fact whose date and place describe it, by the fact's id. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_LifeEventDate_record_fact_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#site_event_record_date> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_LifeEventDate_reported_in> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_LifeEventDate_reported_in> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The day of the first issue that reported the event, where no date is printed. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_LifeEventMainPerson> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_LifeEventMainPerson> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One main person of a life event and their part in it (the baby, a parent, the bride, the groom, the boy, the one who died, the one remembered); each part means a declared local subproperty of rico:affectsOrAffected or rico:hasOrHadParticipant (EventParts). A public view of LifeEventMainPerson; source-scoped values are retained without asserting an unqualified historical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_LifeEventMainPerson_part> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_LifeEventMainPerson_part> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The person's part in the event. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_LifeEventMainPerson_person_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_LifeEventMainPerson_person_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The person, by the person's id in the record. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PlaceIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PlaceIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One identifier of a person, organisation, place or holder, carried only on evidence, never from a match of names. Outside ids are read on their authority's own pages; merged local ids cite the registered source of the adjudicated merge. A public view of PlaceIdentifier; source-scoped values are retained without asserting an unqualified historical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PlaceIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#Identifier> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PlaceIdentifier_accessed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PlaceIdentifier_accessed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The day it was read on its authority's own pages. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PlaceIdentifier_accessed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#site_identifier_reading> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PlaceIdentifier_source_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PlaceIdentifier_source_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The authority the identifier comes from, a registered source, by its id. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PlaceIdentifier_source_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#hasIdentifierType> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PlaceIdentifier_url> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PlaceIdentifier_url> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The identifier's page on the authority's host. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PlaceIdentifier_value> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PlaceIdentifier_value> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The identifier as its authority writes it. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PlaceIdentifier_value> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#textualValue> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PrintedAddress> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PrintedAddress> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Where some printed words stand: the page picture, a box on it in the picture's own pixels, and the words read in that box. A public view of PrintedAddress; source-scoped values are retained without asserting an unqualified historical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PrintedAddress_bbox> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PrintedAddress_bbox> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The box on the picture: left, top, width and height, in the picture's pixels. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PrintedAddress_image_uri> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PrintedAddress_image_uri> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The page picture the box is on, by its name or address. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PrintedAddress_text> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_PrintedAddress_text> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The words read in the box, exactly as read; empty for a patch with no readable line. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Reference> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Reference> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A target identifier present in the final public data; no private identity details are supplied." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Review> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Review> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Whether a person has reviewed a statement, who and on what day. A public view of Review; source-scoped values are retained without asserting an unqualified historical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Review_by> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Review_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Who reviewed it. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Review_on> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Review_on> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The day it was reviewed. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Review_state> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Review_state> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Pending, or approved by a reviewer. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedEvent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One life event, once for each happening across every issue (a birth, a wedding, a death, a memorial and so on): its kind, its main people and their parts, its dates and its place. A public view of SharedEvent; source-scoped values are retained without asserting an unqualified historical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#Event> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedEvent_dates> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedEvent_dates> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The event's dates: as printed (in either calendar), or the first report's day, or the preferred record statement's. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedEvent_evidence_basis> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedEvent_evidence_basis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "records_only: a death known from records alone, which no issue prints. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedEvent_evidence_basis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#site_event_evidence_basis> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedEvent_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedEvent_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The event's id, which each issue's life events name. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedEvent_location_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedEvent_location_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Where the event happened, by the place's id. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedEvent_main_people> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedEvent_main_people> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The people the event is about, each with their part; empty while unresolved. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedEvent_main_people> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#hasOrHadParticipant> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedEvent_proposed_type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedEvent_proposed_type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "For an event of kind other: the kind proposed for it, awaiting the owner's approval. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedEvent_type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedEvent_type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The one kind of the event. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedEvent_type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#hasEventType> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One source's statement as the shared record keeps it: a fact with its subject, its form and its evidence located on the printed page where the site writer found it. A public view of SharedFact; source-scoped values are retained without asserting an unqualified historical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Statement> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#Relation> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_attribution> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_attribution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Who recorded the statement, and on what day. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_citations> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_citations> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The evidence: where in which sources the statement is found. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_date> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_date> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "When, as the source gives it. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_event_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_event_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The life event the statement concerns, by its id in the record. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_evidence_confidence> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_evidence_confidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "How sure the evidence makes the statement. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_evidence_confidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#relationCertainty> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_holocaust_related> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_holocaust_related> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "True when the statement concerns the Holocaust. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The fact's id in the record. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_identity_confidence> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_identity_confidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "How sure it is that the statement is about this person. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_organization_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_organization_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The organisation the statement concerns, by its id in the record. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_place_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_place_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Where, by the place's id in the record. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_proposed_type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_proposed_type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "For a statement of type other: the type proposed for it, awaiting the owner's approval. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_qualifiers> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_qualifiers> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "More about the statement, as named texts. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_related_name> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_related_name> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "For kinship: the relative's name, where the relative has no person of their own. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_related_person_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_related_person_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "For kinship: the relative, by the person's id in the record. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_relationship_type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_relationship_type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "For kinship: how the relative is related, from the subject to the relative. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_review> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_review> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Whether a person has reviewed the statement. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_review> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#site_standing> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_status> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_status> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The statement's standing: proposed, accepted, disputed or rejected. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_status> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#site_standing> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "What the statement is about: a birth, a death, a residence, an occupation and so on. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_value> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedFact_value> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The statement's words or value, such as an occupation. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedOrganization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedOrganization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One organisation of the record: its id, the name shown, its names and evidenced identifiers; its offices and members are sourced facts. A public view of SharedOrganization; source-scoped values are retained without asserting an unqualified historical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedOrganization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://lod.ehri-project-test.eu/ontology#CorporateBody> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedOrganization_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedOrganization_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The organisation's id. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPerson> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPerson> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One person of the record, across every issue: their id, the name shown, every name they are known by, their gender, what became of them, their portrait and evidenced identifiers. A public view of SharedPerson; source-scoped values are retained without asserting an unqualified historical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPerson> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://lod.ehri-project-test.eu/ontology#Person> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPerson_gender> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPerson_gender> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The person's gender, or unknown. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPerson_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPerson_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The person's id, kept for ever: never renamed, reused or deleted. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPlace> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPlace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One place of the record: its names, its kind, the place it lies in, its coordinates and its outside identifiers. A public view of SharedPlace; source-scoped values are retained without asserting an unqualified historical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPlace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#Place> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPlace_coordinates> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPlace_coordinates> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Where it lies: latitude then longitude, in degrees. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPlace_coordinates> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#geographicalCoordinates> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPlace_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPlace_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The place's id. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPlace_identifiers> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPlace_identifiers> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The place's outside identifiers, each with its evidence. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPlace_identifiers> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#hasOrHadIdentifier> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPlace_parent_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPlace_parent_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The place it lies in, by its id. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPlace_parent_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasPartOf> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPlace_type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SharedPlace_type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "What kind of place it is: a city, a town, a street, a camp and so on. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A record the statements rest on: a book, an archive's database, a family document, the paper itself and the like, registered once and cited by its id. A public view of Source; source-scoped values are retained without asserting an unqualified historical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://lod.ehri-project-test.eu/ontology#RecordResource> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source_author> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source_author> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Who wrote the source: an institution, never a member of its staff. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source_author> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#hasCreator> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source_editor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source_editor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Who edited the source. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source_host> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source_host> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The web host the source's records are served from, without www: every address cited from it is on that host or a subdomain of it. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source_host> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#site_source_host> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The source's id in the record, which citations name. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source_kind> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source_kind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "What kind of source it is: a book, a memorial book, an archive's database, the paper and so on. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source_published> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source_published> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "When or where the source was published, as written. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source_repository> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source_repository> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The old free-text holder, read for one release; holder_id replaces it. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source_url_pattern> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source_url_pattern> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "How an address of one of the source's records is formed. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source_work_id> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_Source_work_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The id of the work in the project's files; never published where it is a file name. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SourcedDate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SourcedDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A date a source gives: a normalized start (and end, for a range) with how precise it is, or the words as printed with their calendar, or both. A public view of SourcedDate; source-scoped values are retained without asserting an unqualified historical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SourcedDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#Date> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SourcedDate_end> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SourcedDate_end> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The end of a range of dates, written as the start is. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SourcedDate_inferred> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SourcedDate_inferred> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "True when the date was worked out rather than read. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SourcedDate_precision> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SourcedDate_precision> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "How much of the date is known: year, month, day or range. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SourcedDate_printed_calendar> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SourcedDate_printed_calendar> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The calendar of the printed words. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SourcedRelation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SourcedRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One source's statement that a person is related to another, from the subject to the relative, of a released kinship type, or of type other with a proposed type. A public view of SourcedRelation; source-scoped values are retained without asserting an unqualified historical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SourcedRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Statement> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SourcedRelation_relationship_type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SourcedRelation_relationship_type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "For kinship: how the relative is related, from the subject to the relative. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SourcedRelation_review> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SourcedRelation_review> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Whether a person has reviewed the statement. Public source-scoped field; it does not assert an unqualified biographical relationship." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_SourcedRelation_review> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#site_standing> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_birth> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_birth> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A source-scoped birth assertion. Its object is the preserved statement value, not an unqualified date or historical event. A sourced birth date; a birth place uses rico:hasBirthPlace independently, including when no date is known." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_birth> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#hasBirthDate> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_burial> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_burial> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A source-scoped burial assertion. Its object is the preserved statement value, not an unqualified date or historical event. A sourced interment, optionally dated and placed; distinct from death." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_burial> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#fact_types_burial> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_commemoration> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_commemoration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A source-scoped commemoration assertion. Its object is the preserved statement value, not an unqualified date or historical event. A sourced act of remembrance; event participation may link its event." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_commemoration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#fact_types_commemoration> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_death> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_death> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A source-scoped death assertion. Its object is the preserved statement value, not an unqualified date or historical event. A sourced death date; a death place uses rico:hasDeathPlace independently, including when no date is known." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_death> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#hasDeathDate> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_deportation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_deportation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A source-scoped deportation assertion. Its object is the preserved statement value, not an unqualified date or historical event. A sourced forced removal at a date and place; event participation may link its event." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_deportation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#fact_types_deportation> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_education> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_education> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A source-scoped education assertion. Its object is the preserved statement value, not an unqualified date or historical event. School attendance or education at a specified time." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_education> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#fact_types_education> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_emigration> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_emigration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A source-scoped emigration assertion. Its object is the preserved statement value, not an unqualified date or historical event. A dated departure to live elsewhere; establishes neither death nor survival." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_emigration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#fact_types_emigration> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_event_participation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_event_participation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A source-scoped event_participation assertion. Its object is the preserved statement value, not an unqualified date or historical event. Taking part in an event with an explicit mention role; weddings are events, not marriage facts." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_event_participation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasParticipantIn> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_ghetto_role> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_ghetto_role> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A source-scoped ghetto_role assertion. Its object is the preserved statement value, not an unqualified date or historical event. A sourced ghetto activity not expressible as membership or office; use membership or office whenever those fit." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_ghetto_role> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#fact_types_ghetto_role> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_kinship> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_kinship> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A source-scoped kinship assertion. Its object is the preserved statement value, not an unqualified date or historical event. A source's statement that the person is related, in a stated way, to a named person who need not be identified" .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_kinship> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#hasFamilyAssociationWith> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_membership> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_membership> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A source-scoped membership assertion. Its object is the preserved statement value, not an unqualified date or historical event. A person isOrWasMemberOf a group, inverse of group hasOrHadMember, qualified through MembershipRelation." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_membership> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasMemberOf> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_occupation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_occupation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A source-scoped occupation assertion. Its object is the preserved statement value, not an unqualified date or historical event. An occupation, optionally bounded in time." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_occupation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#hasOrHadOccupationOfType> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_office> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_office> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A source-scoped office assertion. Its object is the preserved statement value, not an unqualified date or historical event. Holding a Position at a time; person occupiesOrOccupied the position, qualified through PositionHoldingRelation." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_office> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#occupiesOrOccupied> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_other> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_other> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A source-scoped other assertion. Its object is the preserved statement value, not an unqualified date or historical event. An assertion awaiting an owner-approved type; requires a nonempty proposed_type." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_other> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#fact_types_other> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_parenthood> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_parenthood> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A source-scoped parenthood assertion. Its object is the preserved statement value, not an unqualified date or historical event. Parenthood of an unnamed child without inventing a person node; claims naming a relative use kinship, and links between identified people use relationships. Deprecated in 1.2.0: represent the child as a person and link each parent by parent_of." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_parenthood> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#fact_types_parenthood> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_partisan_service> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_partisan_service> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A source-scoped partisan_service assertion. Its object is the preserved statement value, not an unqualified date or historical event. A sourced partisan activity beyond membership or office; use membership or office whenever those fit." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_partisan_service> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#fact_types_partisan_service> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_residence> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_residence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A source-scoped residence assertion. Its object is the preserved statement value, not an unqualified date or historical event. Residence in a place at a specified time." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_residence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#hasOrHadLocation> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_survival> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_survival> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A source-scoped survival assertion. Its object is the preserved statement value, not an unqualified date or historical event. Evidence that a person was alive at a specified time." .
<https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#export_assertion_survival> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://pruzhany.org/ns/sourced-entities#fact_types_survival> .
